  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A slash to the side of your head leaves teeth visible through a gaping cut in your cheek, and cuts through the mandibular bone on that side, severing it near the hinge that is your temporomandibular joint.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). Lose 1d10 teeth – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.fBcZhOBn8IpoVqQ1]{Amputation (Challenging)}, plus suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.hCadFsTRvLN9faaY]{Broken Bone (Major)}. Also, your lower jaw is now disturbingly unstable and so distracting that you suffer an additional -20 penalty to all Tests until you take an Action to stuff your beard, handkerchief or other suitable article into your mouth to bite down on in order to hold your jaw in place.</p>"
    },
